ith the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":225273,"global_rank":137495},{"name":"Marc-Chiu/anagrams","owner":"Marc-Chiu","html_url":"https://github.com/Marc-Chiu/anagrams","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Using Node.js and Javascript to make anagrams game","topics":[],"score":225273,"global_rank":137497},{"name":"robertipk/React_Web3","owner":"robertipk","html_url":"https://github.com/robertipk/React_Web3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Miscellaenous React Web3 snippets","topics":[],"score":225273,"global_rank":137498},{"name":"AndrewJFleming/purgation-react-ecommerce","owner":"AndrewJFleming","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrewJFleming/purgation-react-ecommerce","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Digital products ecommerce web app built with the MERN stack.","topics":[],"score":225273,"global_rank":137506},{"name":"odingol/n